### BluePrints RT - ejemplos REST (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@base = {{host}}/api/v1/blueprints

### Todos los planos
GET {{base}}

### Planos de un autor (query param)
GET {{base}}?author=juan

### Planos de un autor (path)
GET {{base}}/juan

### Un plano
GET {{base}}/juan/plano-1

### Ruta alternativa sin version
GET {{host}}/api/blueprints/juan/plano-1

### Plano inexistente -> 404
GET {{base}}/juan/no-existe

### Crear plano -> 201
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "marco",
  "name": "sala",
  "points": [ { "x": 10, "y": 10 }, { "x": 200, "y": 10 }, { "x": 200, "y": 150 } ]
}

### Crear el mismo plano otra vez -> 409
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "marco",
  "name": "sala",
  "points": []
}

### Crear con datos invalidos -> 400 (mensaje por campo)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "nombre con espacios",
  "name": "",
  "points": [ { "x": 99999, "y": 0 } ]
}

### JSON mal formado -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "marco"}

### Reemplazar todos los puntos -> 200 (publica type "replace")
PUT {{base}}/marco/sala
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [ { "x": 50, "y": 50 }, { "x": 300, "y": 300 } ]
}

### Agregar un punto -> 202 (publica type "points")
PUT {{base}}/marco/sala/points
Content-Type: application/json

{ "x": 420, "y": 250 }

### Eliminar -> 200 (publica type "deleted")
DELETE {{base}}/marco/sala

### Eliminar otra vez -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/marco/sala

### Health check
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### OpenAPI (JSON). Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
